{"ref":"BDB, אַתָּ֫ה","hw":"אַתָּ֫ה","html":"<big><span dir=\"rtl\">אַתָּ֫ה</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אָ֑תָּה</span></big>  (so regularly; but 26–7 times, with different disj. accents, <span dir=\"rtl\">אַ֑תָּה</span>: v. Fr<sup>MM 228</sup>; Sta<sup>§ 178 a (read 8 for 18)</sup> <strong>pron. 2 s. m. thou (</strong>for <em>anta</em>, v. supr.; cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">נָתַתָּ</span> for <span dir=\"rtl\">נָתַנְתָּ</span><strong>)</strong> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 3:11\" href=\"/Genesis.3.11\">Gn 3:11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 3:19\" href=\"/Genesis.3.19\">19</a> + often. Written <span dir=\"rtl\">אַתָּ</span> †<a data-ref=\"I Samuel 24:18\" href=\"/I_Samuel.24.18\">1 S 24:18</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 6:4\" href=\"/Psalms.6.4\">ψ 6:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 1:10\" href=\"/Job.1.10\">Jb 1:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 7:22\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.7.22\">Ec 7:22</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 9:6\" href=\"/Nehemiah.9.6\">Ne 9:6</a>. Appended to a vb. for emph., <a data-ref=\"Exodus 18:19\" href=\"/Exodus.18.19\">Ex 18:19</a><sup>(×2)</sup> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 17:56\" href=\"/I_Samuel.17.56\">1 S 17:56</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁאַל אַתָּה</span> inquire <em>thou</em>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 20:8\" href=\"/I_Samuel.20.8\">20:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 22:18\" href=\"/I_Samuel.22.18\">22:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 43:26\" href=\"/Isaiah.43.26\">Is 43:26</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">סַפֵּר אַתָּה</span>. Added for the purpose of strengthening a gen. or accus. sf. <a data-ref=\"I Kings 21:19\" href=\"/I_Kings.21.19\">1 K 21:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 22:19\" href=\"/Proverbs.22.19\">Pr 22:19</a> (Ges<sup>§ 135, 2</sup>).","next":"BDB, אתי","prev":"BDB, אנת"}